{"contentHash":"1292f5cd43cd65cfd1e22f068a06f867b7e2c1e55c3cccffb5f7494a82775331","path":"apps/borso-fr/site/src/warp/warp-drive.ts","ledgerHash":"c9cc14decde46c91990639a64998fea47f78ae890f43c022107f6ddd99ee7fd2","reviewer":"standards-reviewer","sealedAt":"2026-08-20T08:35:43.771Z","note":"Fourth pass, working-tree content. Delta since the 08:22 seal is the holdMilliseconds parameter, HOLD_CUSTOM_PROPERTY and the two header paragraphs. The header's cross-file claim was verified: --transition-hold is consumed by apps/borso-fr/site/12-travaux/index.html:22 and art/mondrian/index.html:17,21 as duration-[var(--transition-hold)], and JUMPING_BODY_CLASS by index.html:45,107. Callers match the default: home-page.ts:16 passes JUMP_DURATION_MILLISECONDS, the two galaxy-less pages take PAGE_FADE_DURATION_MILLISECONDS. Still follows browser-edge-module: one exported entry, state outside React in warp-jump.store.ts, the decision in warp-navigation.core.ts. No disable comment, no effect, no untrusted input."}
